cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the experimental data, cite this release.
title: "BlindVision software and experimental data release"
type: software
abstract: >-
  BlindVision is a dual-device assistive-navigation system comprising Smart
  Goggles software, Smart Stick firmware, sensor-fusion components, and
  experimental data and derived result tables supplied for the project.
authors:
  - given-names: "Alishba"
    family-names: "Fatima"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/makfatima/BlindVision"
version: "0.2.1--10class"
date-released: "2026-08-12"
keywords:
  - assistive technology
  - sensor fusion
  - obstacle detection
  - wearable sensors
  - reproducibility
notes: >-
  The data directory contains experimental data and derived result tables
  supplied for the BlindVision project. These files are retained as supplied.
  Lower-level source artifacts that are not present in this release are not
  represented as included.
